WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.725
A mixture is different substances mingled together, not chemically joined.

2
00:00:05.426 --> 00:00:08.001
Air, enlarged millions of times.

3
00:00:09.781 --> 00:00:12.781
Nitrogen: its own particles, unchanged.

4
00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:19.222
Oxygen: also its own particles, not joined to the nitrogen.

5
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.120
Different substances, mingled but not joined, make a mixture.
